For instance, let tmp = product.TotalStockValue = product.Price * product.Quantity sets the length of a product name.

Using the method syntax, you can use the ForEach method to directly set the property value of an object in a collection.

For example, product.TotalStockValue = product.Price * product.Quantity assigns the length of the product name to another property within the product object.

